   351                           * |    user ...
   352                           * +----------------+----------------+----------------+----------------+
   353                           * |    port ...
   354                           * +----------------+----------------+----------------+----------------+
   355                           * |    rem_addr ...
   356                           * +----------------+----------------+----------------+----------------+
   357                           * |    data...
